# The Resident Evil inventory: STATUS with the ECG, the plate tabs and the COMMAND menu
Output images/demo/hud_re.gif
Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_REPO" && clear && DEMO_FRANCHISE=resident_evil nvim --cmd "luafile $DEMO_LUA"`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Type "l"
Sleep 700ms
Type "l"
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Sleep 700ms
Tab
Sleep 1500ms
